{"title":"The 35th Anniversary of the Hubble Space Telescope","link":"https://kottke.org/25/04/the-35th-anniversary-of-the-hubble-space-telescope","date":1745948883000,"content":"\n        <p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/hubble-35-01.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/hubble-35-01.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/hubble-35-01.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"806\" alt=\"the Eagle Nebula\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/hubble-35-02.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/hubble-35-02.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/hubble-35-02.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"770\" alt=\"the Sombrero galaxy\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/hubble-35-03.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/hubble-35-03.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/hubble-35-03.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"663\" alt=\"the Large Magellanic Cloud\" /></p>\n\n<p>The Hubble Space Telescope was launched into space 35 years ago and in celebration of <a href=\"https://esahubble.org/news/heic2505/\">that milestone</a>, Alan Taylor collected <a href=\"https://www.theatlantic.com/photo/2025/04/photos-35th-anniversary-hubble-space-telescope/682628/\">some recent images from the Hubble</a>, whose mission is still ongoing.</p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Alan%20Taylor\">Alan Taylor</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/astronomy\">astronomy</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Hubble%20telescope\">Hubble telescope</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/photography\">photography</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/science\">science</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/space\">space</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/04/the-35th-anniversary-of-the-hubble-space-telescope\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"0f993ecb141d056468605e56a2d5365f05a263446b51f1bb5f8177be65c9cc70","category":"Sites"}